	upload to roboflow and annotate them.
	use google colab or kaggle to train your yolo model to the custom dataset. roboflow provides the code to export.
	paste code and then run the required functions like train, predict, etc.
	save the model with the best weights in runs>detect>weights>best.pt
	download the file and load it. use it to track the objects.
	
