4.using bert for nlp:
	use speech_recognition, sounddevice and soundfile to convert audio into text.
	train the bert model to your custom dataset and use this model to classify the text.
	to train bert make a custom dataset of the inputs and the desired outputs and save them in a csv file.
	load the file and make sure the classes or outputs are ints. if not add seperate columns with an int value for each unique label in a 		class. multiple classes can have same int values
	now use scikit-learn to split the dataset into train and test datasets.
	use tokenizer to encode the datasets into format that bert can understand.
	now train the bert model to your custom dataset using tensorflow.
	
	issues faced:
